<title>ITALY: Italy's TIM in sales accord with Vobis unit.</title>
<headline>Italy's TIM in sales accord with Vobis unit.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian mobile phone operator Telecom Italia Mobile (TIM) said it had reached an accord with the Vobis group, Germany's leading personal computer retailer, to sell TIM products in Vobis Microcomputer SpA stores in Italy.</p>
<p>TIM said in a statement that the accord meant it would have a further 36 points of sale for its products and services in Italy. TIM said its sales network includes 1,392 dealers for a total 2,185 &quot;TIM Centres&quot; and 18 specialised mobile phone shops.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
